[HEADER]
id: cannon_run
title: Chainshot Against The Deep
ascii_art: ../art/kraken_attack_anim.txt

[CONTENT]
A tentacle crashes over the rail, slick with barnacles and teeth.
The gunner screams for a target call.

[OPTIONS]
fire_chain | Fire chainshot through the tendons -> ../depths/wake.level
miss_shot | Panic and fire too early -> ../endings/dragged.level

[DIRECTIVES]
input_mode: choice
ascii_art_mode: animated

[OPTION_EFFECTS]
option=fire_chain add_flag=kraken_wounded
